    "Every successful snapshot matches raw online KV, raw top-128 IDs/logits, LSE tolerance, token IDs, positions, valid-KV boundary and prompt/response loss masks.",
    "All ten lifecycle snapshots remain readable after their serving producer exits.",
    "No Host/device slots are quarantined; new staging allocated/limit metrics match server_info through the real HTTP metrics endpoint."
